pve-gpu-sched (0.2.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package release
  * BAND scheduler with Weighted Fair Queuing (WFQ)
  * VFIO mediated device (mdev) interface for KVM/Proxmox VE
  * Shadow page tables for GPU memory isolation
  * IRQ forwarding via eventfd
  * Support for NVIDIA (Fermi/Kepler/Maxwell/Pascal/Turing/Ampere/Ada)
  * Support for AMD (GCN/RDNA)
  * Up to 16 concurrent VMs sharing a single GPU
  * CLI management tool (pve-gpu-sched)
  * DKMS support for automatic kernel module rebuild
  * systemd service for auto-loading

 -- PVE GPU Scheduler Project <gpu-sched@proxmox.local>  Tue, 15 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
